### Register User
POST http://localhost:3001/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "user",
  "email": "nguyentyennhi90@dtu.edu.vn",
  "password": "987654"
}
### Login User
POST http://localhost:3001/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "2222222"
}
### Get Current User
GET http://localhost:3001/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer <token>

### Change Password
PUT http://localhost:3001/api/auth/change-password
Authorization: Bearer <token>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "oldPassword": "2222222",
  "newPassword": "123456"
}

### Logout User
POST http://localhost:3001/api/auth/logout  
Authorization: Bearer <token>

### Admin Dashboard
GET http://localhost:3001/api/auth/admin/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer <token>
### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### GOOGLE LOGIN (Firebase Auth)
### -------------------------------------------------------------------------

# 1. Login bằng Firebase ID Token (Lấy ID Token từ frontend hoặc Firebase CLI)
POST http://localhost:3001/api/auth/google-login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "idToken": "PASTE_FIREBASE_ID_TOKEN_HERE"
}

###

# 2. Thiếu idToken -> mong đợi 400
POST http://localhost:3001/api/auth/google-login
Content-Type: application/json

{
}

###

# 3. idToken không hợp lệ / giả mạo -> mong đợi 401
POST http://localhost:3001/api/auth/google-login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "idToken": "fake_token_123456"
}

### Quên mật khẩu: luôn mong đợi 200 với email hợp lệ/không tồn tại
POST http://localhost:3001/api/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "nguyentyennhi90@dtu.edu.vn"
}

### Đặt lại mật khẩu: lấy raw token từ email, không phải hash trong MongoDB
POST http://localhost:3001/api/auth/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "token": "PASTE_RAW_TOKEN_FROM_EMAIL",
  "newPassword": "new-password-123"
}